But what if `length` was NOT clipped (because `op+length <= oend-LASTLITERALS`), but `length > lowPrefix-match`? Then it takes the second branch, copies `copySize = lowPrefix-match` bytes from the dictionary, and then `restSize = length - copySize` bytes from `lowPrefix`.

